   "value": "<p><em>Innate Technique</em></p><blockquote><p>Did you know most gamblers stop before their big hit? Let's hope you don’t, as failing may mean death, but your luck has got you.</p></blockquote><p>Your innate technique grants you the following features as you gain levels in a class with the Innate Technique feature:</p><ul><li><strong>1st level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.ekaS8GYbKDcFu0i8]{Great Luck}</li><li><strong>3rd level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.JgbhHu3Xdg6y4dKN]{Domain Expansion: Idle Death Gamble}</li><li><strong>6th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.iy3YyszuB0gKuyT1]{On a Roll}</li><li><strong>11th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.acpMW606uujEXSIi]{The Fever}</li><li><strong>18th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.BL0AkVup5SylGoSO]{Luckiest Sorcerer Alive}</li></ul>",
